    "tier": 2,
    "description": "<p>A stern Seattle librarian and expert local historian whose Cybermancy summons spectral projections shaped by the books around her.</p><section class=\"cybermancy-fast-play\"><h3>FAST PLAY</h3><p><strong><em>Opening:</em></strong> Be stern but helpful. Answer sincere questions and use Reference Authority during research.</p><p><strong><em>Default:</em></strong> Correct bad behavior first. Use Withering Correction against bullying or deception.</p><p><strong><em>If Disrespected:</em></strong> Resolve Respect the Collection. Remain Hostile until the offender makes amends or leaves.</p><p><strong><em>If Hostile:</em></strong> Use Spectral Citation normally. Spend Fear on The Stacks Answer Back against clustered threats.</p><p><strong><em>Remember:</em></strong> Every magical attack reflects nearby books; only its appearance changes.</p><p><strong><em>Goal:</em></strong> Be an intimidating guardian and expert first, dangerous Cybermancer second.</p></section>",
